                    </div>
                    <div class="food-item bg-[#0B0D0C] border border-emerald-900/30 rounded-xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div><h4 class="font-bold text-gray-100 text-sm">Lomito Árabe Mixto</h4><p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Repollo, tomate, queso, carne, pollo, salsa de ajo.</p></div>
                        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-emerald-900/20 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-bold text-emerald-400 text-sm">30.000 GS.</span><button onclick="addToCart('Lomito Árabe Mixto', 30000)" class="bg-emerald-500/10 hover:bg-emerald-500 hover:text-black text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all cursor-pointer">+ Agregar</button></div>
