                        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-emerald-900/20 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-bold text-emerald-400 text-sm">70.000 GS.</span><button onclick="addToCart('Chivito de la Casa', 70000)" class="bg-emerald-500/10 hover:bg-emerald-500 hover:text-black text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all cursor-pointer">+ Agregar</button></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="food-item bg-[#0B0D0C] border border-emerald-900/30 rounded-xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div><h4 class="font-bold text-gray-100 text-sm">Lomipizza (4 Porciones)</h4><p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Lechuga, tomate, lomito, huevo, jamón, queso, topping, salsa de tomate, orégano, queso muzzarella y aceituna.</p></div>
                        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-emerald-900/20 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-bold text-emerald-400 text-sm">80.000 GS.</span><button onclick="addToCart('Lomipizza (4 Porciones)', 80000)" class="bg-emerald-500/10 hover:bg-emerald-500 hover:text-black text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all cursor-pointer">+ Agregar</button></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="food-item bg-[#0B0D0C] border border-emerald-900/30 rounded-xl p-4 flex flex-col justify-between">
                        <div><h4 class="font-bold text-gray-100 text-sm">Lomipizza (8 Porciones)</h4><p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Lechuga, tomate, lomito, huevo, jamón, queso, topping, salsa de tomate, orégano, queso muzzarella y aceituna.</p></div>
                        <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-emerald-900/20 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-bold text-emerald-400 text-sm">120.000 GS.</span><button onclick="addToCart('Lomipizza (8 Porciones)', 120000)" class="bg-emerald-500/10 hover:bg-emerald-500 hover:text-black text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/30 text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition-all cursor-pointer">+ Agregar</button></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 5. PIZZAS TRADICIONALES + 2 SABORES -->
            <div class="menu-section bg-[#141816]/60 border border-emerald-900/40 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-xl">
                <div class="mb-6 pb-3 border-b border-emerald-900/40">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-wide flex items-center gap-2"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span> Pizzas</h2>
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Elige tamaño (8 o 12 porciones), borde tradicional o relleno, o arma tu pizza de 2 sabores</p>
                </div>

                <!-- APARTADO 2 SABORES -->
                <div class="food-item bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-950/50 to-[#0B0D0C] border border-emerald-500/40 rounded-xl p-4 mb-5 shadow-lg">
                    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
                        <div>
                            <span class="inline-block bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md mb-1">2 Sabores</span>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Pizza de 2 Sabores (Mitad y Mitad)</h4>
                            <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-0.5">Elige 2 sabores, porciones y borde. Si tienen distinto precio, se aplica el de mayor valor.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-left sm:text-right">
                            <span class="block text-[10px] text-gray-400">Precio:</span>
